  customStoryStylePrompt: varied standalone illustrated vignettes across mystery, comedy, fairy tale, folklore, science fiction, festivals and exploration; warm complete miniature narratives with surprising actions
  additionalStoryRequirements: PocketStriker interlude; 2-3 concise narrative lines, total at most 200 characters; choose protagonists suited to each subject; stories may take place outside battles and arenas; no football or long exposition
