  customImageStylePrompt: "playful 2D storybook cartoon, oversized expressive heads and eyes, compact bodies, soft rounded silhouettes, thick clean outlines, flat cel shading, vibrant candy colors with coral, turquoise, lemon yellow and lavender accents, simple backgrounds, readable full-body action, gentle lighting; no photorealism, realistic anatomy, oil-painting texture or cinematic lighting; no text, lettering, logos or HUD"
